              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Experiment is a dedicated-deck commercial card game where players collect coloured laboratory cards to complete task cards."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Designed by Tim De Rycke and Sander Vernyns, Experiment is a laboratory-themed dedicated deck game where players mix colours and complete professor-assigned tasks over twelve rounds."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "3-6 players use the table arrangement described for Experiment."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Experiment laboratory and task cards"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Experiment laboratory and task cards, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal laboratory cards and task options from the dedicated deck; each round begins by determining player influence."
            }
